{"unit_id":"yangwuan55__dsh-accounts#card-zh","repo":"yangwuan55/dsh-accounts","commit":"396c6a1fa81909a47e5742ccfb792388e1da35ed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-accounts 是面向 DSH 的凭据管理插件，提供浏览器、命令行和网页客户端入口。核心插件注册账号列表、凭据 CLI 执行和凭据 HTTP 请求工具，并向系统提示加入使用指引；浏览器子插件可把账号字段填入当前页面，管理插件提供账号网页管理，客户端设置面板也有账号分区。账号支持登录字段、环境变量和单值令牌，可选 TOTP；用户可按账号配置可填字段和域名。适合需要在 DSH 中管理账号、调用带凭据的 CLI 或 API，以及在浏览器登录时复用凭据的场景。需要 DSH credentials 服务；网页管理依赖 webServer，代填需要 browser 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67","lib/index.js:126","lib/index.js:187","lib/fill-plugin.js:60","lib/manage.js:127","lib/settings-ui.js:1","lib/accounts.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"yangwuan55__dsh-accounts#card-en","repo":"yangwuan55/dsh-accounts","commit":"396c6a1fa81909a47e5742ccfb792388e1da35ed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-accounts manages credentials in DSH. Its tools list accounts, run local CLI commands with stored environment variables, and call HTTP APIs with credential headers. It fills browser forms and provides a web management page. Records support login fields, environment variables, tokens, and TOTP.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67","lib/index.js:126","lib/index.js:187","lib/fill-plugin.js:60","lib/manage.js:127","lib/settings-ui.js:1","lib/accounts.js:1"]}
