{"unit_id":"yangwuan55__dsh-accounts#feature-1","repo":"yangwuan55/dsh-accounts","commit":"396c6a1fa81909a47e5742ccfb792388e1da35ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-accounts 提供「账号列表」功能：查看已保存账号的 id、类型、标签、TOTP 标记和域名信息，不返回密码或令牌值。通过 account_list 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:72"]}
{"unit_id":"yangwuan55__dsh-accounts#feature-2","repo":"yangwuan55/dsh-accounts","commit":"396c6a1fa81909a47e5742ccfb792388e1da35ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-accounts 提供「凭据 CLI 执行」功能：从账号记录选择环境变量并注入本地 CLI，执行后返回退出码及脱敏后的输出。通过 credential_run 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:126"]}
{"unit_id":"yangwuan55__dsh-accounts#feature-3","repo":"yangwuan55/dsh-accounts","commit":"396c6a1fa81909a47e5742ccfb792388e1da35ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-accounts 提供「凭据 HTTP 请求」功能：把账号环境变量映射到请求头并请求指定 HTTP API，返回状态和响应内容。通过 credential_request 工具触发，可设置方法、请求体和超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:187"]}
{"unit_id":"yangwuan55__dsh-accounts#feature-4","repo":"yangwuan55/dsh-accounts","commit":"396c6a1fa81909a47e5742ccfb792388e1da35ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-accounts 提供「浏览器表单代填」功能：按 CSS 选择器把账号字段填入当前浏览器页面，并可提交表单；可配置字段映射和提交方式。通过 account_fill 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/fill-plugin.js:60"]}
